!! cmavo: ca'u (FAHA2)

!!! Proposed Definition
In front of, forwards, to the front of.  Indicates that something is to the front of the speaker.  When tagging a sumti, indicates that the relation described by the bridi in question is north of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
farna tcita (provisional)

!!! See Also
* {crane}
* {farna}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* front
* 

!!! Usage Examples
;dy co'a klama gi'e gunta le ca'u pa moi be la molki:D started going and attacked the front-most mill.
;lo junki ca'a dinju gasnu ca'u le mi skami jarco:A spider is actually building a web in front of my computer screen.
;la noltruni'u cu ca'u sanli:The queen stood forward.

!!! Notes
"dinju" is not normally "web"; this is inferred from context because
it's a spider making it.


!! General Section Issues

All attitudinal modifiers are weird.

